      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算 $(I-A)(I+A)^{-1}$",
        "验证行列式",
        "验证正交性"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rotation_matrix_proof",
        "template": "证明矩阵运算的几何意义",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "旋转矩阵证明",
          "steps": [
            "$(I - A)(I + A)^{-1} = \\frac{1}{1+a^2}\\begin{pmatrix} 1-a^2 & -2a \\\\ 2a & 1-a^2 \\end{pmatrix}$",
            "令 $R = \\frac{1}{1+a^2}\\begin{pmatrix} 1-a^2 & -2a \\\\ 2a & 1-a^2 \\end{pmatrix}$",
            "计算 $\\det(R) = \\frac{1}{(1+a^2)^2}[(1-a^2)^2 + 4a^2] = \\frac{1}{(1+a^2)^2}(1-2a^2+a^4+4a^2) = \\frac{(1+a^2)^2}{(1+a^2)^2} = 1$",
            "计算 $R^T R$：$R^T = \\frac{1}{1+a^2}\\begin{pmatrix} 1-a^2 & 2a \\\\ -2a & 1-a^2 \\end{pmatrix}$",
            "$R^T R = \\frac{1}{(1+a^2)^2}\\begin{pmatrix} (1-a^2)^2+4a^2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4a^2+(1-a^2)^2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{(1+a^2)^2}{(1+a^2)^2}I = I$",
            "因为 $\\det(R)=1$ 且 $R^T R = I$，所以 $R$ 是旋转矩阵"
          ]
        }
